<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY UNION-ACT BEAT NEW SOUTH WALES 56-9.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ACT BEAT NEW SOUTH WALES 56-9.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Capital Territory</p>
<p>beat New South Wales 56-9 (halftime 29-9) in a Super 12 match at</p>
<p>Bruce Stadium on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>ACT - Tries: Patricio Noriega, James Holbeck, George Gregan,</p>
<p>Joe Roff (2), Mitch Hardy (2), David Knox. Conversions: David</p>
<p>Knox (5) Penalties: David Knox (2)</p>
<p>New South Wales - Penalties: Matthew Burke (3).</p>
</text>
